WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.619
"I need to go to Mayor Bloom's office," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:08.039
"People are missing."

3
00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.525
Roxy ran into Jack's backyard.

4
00:00:10.526 --> 00:00:13.954
"Hey, guys!" she said. "I need to . . ."

5
00:00:13.955 --> 00:00:16.968
Jack, Mara, and Terrell weren't there.

6
00:00:16.969 --> 00:00:19.543
"Where are they?" Roxy said. Then she shrugged.

7
00:00:19.544 --> 00:00:26.242
"They probably went into Jack's house."

8
00:00:26.243 --> 00:00:32.032
When Roxy arrived at the mayor's building, she gasped. "Another plant!"

9
00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:34.110
This plant was enormous.

10
00:00:34.111 --> 00:00:37.016
Its twisting vines crept up the side of the building.

11
00:00:37.017 --> 00:00:40.098
It had several large bulbs that seemed to move.

12
00:00:40.099 --> 00:00:45.155
Large pods hung from under the bulbs.

13
00:00:45.156 --> 00:00:47.535
Roxy went into Mayor Bloom's office.

14
00:00:47.536 --> 00:00:49.405
The mayor wasn't there.

15
00:00:49.406 --> 00:00:52.547
Roxy noticed the window was broken.

16
00:00:52.548 --> 00:00:56.742
"Where did he go?" she thought.

17
00:00:56.743 --> 00:00:59.227
Roxy flew over to police headquarters.

18
00:00:59.228 --> 00:01:02.421
Another plant was growing up the side of that building.

19
00:01:02.422 --> 00:01:06.447
"Where did all these plants come from?" Roxy thought.

20
00:01:06.448 --> 00:01:09.448
Detective Smith was in his office.

21
00:01:09.449 --> 00:01:12.119
He was looking at something on his computer.

22
00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:15.194
"Hey, Detective!" Roxy said.

23
00:01:15.195 --> 00:01:18.584
"I just saw your, um, garden outside.

24
00:01:18.585 --> 00:01:22.695
You really need to do some weeding!"

25
00:01:22.696 --> 00:01:25.035
Detective Smith rolled his eyes.

26
00:01:25.036 --> 00:01:27.177
"Very funny, Rocket Girl.

27
00:01:27.178 --> 00:01:29.356
I have no idea what that plant is.

28
00:01:29.357 --> 00:01:32.449
It's very creepy. I don't like it."

29
00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:40.446
"So, what are you watching, Detective?" Roxy asked. "Cartoons?"

30
00:01:40.447 --> 00:01:42.391
Detective Smith looked up at her.

31
00:01:42.392 --> 00:01:44.316
"You're making a lot of jokes today.

32
00:01:44.317 --> 00:01:46.260
This is a security video."

33
00:01:46.261 --> 00:01:50.574
He moved over so Roxy could get a look.

34
00:01:50.575 --> 00:01:56.146
"Several people went missing near the corner of West Street and River Drive," the detective said.

35
00:01:56.147 --> 00:01:59.008
"This video is from a camera there."

36
00:01:59.009 --> 00:02:02.259
Roxy watched cars and trucks drive through the intersection.

37
00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:04.933
People walked along the sidewalk.

38
00:02:04.934 --> 00:02:08.163
Suddenly a woman looked up and pointed at something.

39
00:02:08.164 --> 00:02:10.275
The video didn't have sound.

40
00:02:10.276 --> 00:02:13.522
But Roxy could tell the woman was scared.

41
00:02:13.523 --> 00:02:15.181
Other people looked up.

42
00:02:15.182 --> 00:02:17.105
They screamed and ran off.

43
00:02:17.106 --> 00:02:20.119
Then a twisting vine moved past the camera.

44
00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:24.171
After that the video went black.

45
00:02:24.172 --> 00:02:28.334
"That was weird," Roxy said.

46
00:02:28.335 --> 00:02:30.743
Detective Smith looked out the window.

47
00:02:30.744 --> 00:02:34.461
One of the giant plant's bulbs blocked the sun.

48
00:02:34.462 --> 00:02:36.582
He scratched his head.

49
00:02:36.583 --> 00:02:38.684
"I don't like those plants.

50
00:02:38.685 --> 00:02:40.802
Where did they come from anyway?"

51
00:02:40.803 --> 00:02:43.206
Roxy's watch beeped.

52
00:02:43.207 --> 00:02:46.393
She quickly answered it.

53
00:02:46.394 --> 00:02:48.180
"Mayor Bloom?"

54
00:02:48.181 --> 00:02:51.092
"Rocket Girl!" It was Terrell.

55
00:02:51.093 --> 00:02:54.781
"Remember that plant in Jack's backyard?"

56
00:02:54.782 --> 00:02:58.114
Roxy sighed. "Of course I remember it.

57
00:02:58.115 --> 00:03:01.620
I'm busy right now, though. What's wrong?"

58
00:03:01.621 --> 00:03:04.661
"A lot is wrong!" Terrell said.

59
00:03:04.662 --> 00:03:09.562
"That plant ate us!"

